Version: 1.0.25
Section: admin
Maintainer: IHARC Labs <support@iharc.ca>
Homepage: https://github.com/IHARC/ceasar-control-panel
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, awk, sed, acl, sysstat, setpriv | util-linux (>= 2.33), zstd, lsb-release, idn2, jq, bubblewrap, at
Description: Ceasar standalone hosting control panel
 Ceasar is a self-contained control panel distribution for Ubuntu 24.04 amd64.
 The package includes its native commands, web UI, templates, helpers, and
 optional managed-service and customer-provider integration contracts.
